    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin, jet, control <u><strong>bubbles</strong></u> to rescue little animals.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual puzzle game - unwind here and <u><strong>relieve your stress</strong></u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silky water flow, bouncy bubbles, exhilarating to play however you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Straightforward</strong></u> mechanics: Splitting, Bubble Machines, Gravity, Heating, Water Pipes...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Minimalist yet magical</strong></u> art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <u><strong>one-of-a-kind novel</strong></u> experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600950/extras/19f510d57d6bf944cbb2b54694845c46.poster.avif?t=1753509159\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600950/extras/19f510d57d6bf944cbb2b54694845c46.webm?t=1753509159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600950/extras/19f510d57d6bf944cbb2b54694845c46.mp4?t=1753509159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600950/extras/434481c2a8c1b65d26831210d8f5faf0.poster.avif?t=1753509159\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600950/extras/434481c2a8c1b65d26831210d8f5faf0.webm?t=1753509159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600950/extras/434481c2a8c1b65d26831210d8f5faf0.mp4?t=1753509159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></